  "title": "Cherry Vanilla Chip Muffins",
  "description": "This perfectly lovely muffin is a healthy, low-fat treat without dairy or wheat! Banana and applesauce replace much of the fat, vanilla soy milk replaces the dairy, and rice flour replaces the wheat. Dried cherries and vanilla chips add plenty of pizaz",
